# The CRE toolchain hashes these config files byte-for-byte and prints the
# result as the workflow's "Config hash". Letting Git hand Windows checkouts
# CRLF changes those bytes, so the hash stops matching the one recorded in
# docs/evidence/ and the README. Pin them to LF so the hash is reproducible
# on every platform.
cre/tally-cre/**/config.*.json text eol=lf
